{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05483","headline":"酬张九龄使风见示 · 裴耀卿","name":"酬张九龄使风见示","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"兹地五湖隣，艰哉万里人。\n惊飙翻是托，危浪亦相因。\n宣室才华子，金闺讽议臣。\n承明有三人，去去速归轮。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"裴耀卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05483.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05483","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}